!! Composition
* 女 (nǚ) — woman component; semantic clue
* 马 (mǎ) — horse component; phonetic clue in this simplified form
* The two parts are ''not'' a story about a woman and a horse: phonetic compounds combine meaning and sound hints.

''Related contrast:'' 妈 mā versus 马 mǎ illustrates lexical tone contrast. See [[Grammar/Tones and Pinyin]].


